cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Swasena Sovereign Log — Independent Verifier"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it using the following metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Swasena"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sulaiman1980/swasena-sovereign-log-verifier"
abstract: >-
  An independent, standard-library-only verifier and public specification for a
  tamper-evident, append-only sovereign audit log. Given the log file alone — no
  network, no producer code — any party can recompute the hash chain and detect
  any interior modification, insertion, reordering, or deletion. Every claim is
  falsifiable; limits are stated first. Anteriority of each release is recorded
  with OpenTimestamps (see ANTERIORITY.md).
keywords:
  - tamper-evident log
  - hash chain
  - independent verification
  - transparency log
  - AI data sovereignty
license: MIT
